📌 Project Overview
This project aims to predict employee attrition using machine learning models and derive actionable insights to improve employee retention strategies.
Using the IBM HR Analytics dataset, we analyze key factors influencing attrition and train classification models to make accurate predictions.
🗂 Dataset
Source: IBM HR Analytics Dataset
Features: Various employee-related attributes such as age, job role, work environment, salary, and more.
Target Variable: Attrition (Yes/No)
